Create a Movie class with the following features:
Class Variable:

total_movies - tracks the total number of movie objects created
all_genres - a list containing valid movie genres (Action, Comedy, Drama, Horror, Sci-Fi)

Instance Attributes:

title
director
rating (out of 10)
genre

Instance Methods:

update_rating(new_rating) - updates the movie's rating
display_info() - displays all movie details(title, director, rating and genre)

Class Methods:

get_total_movies() - returns the total number of movies created
from_string(movie_string) - creates a Movie object from a formatted string like "Title|Director|8.5|Drama"

Static Methods:

is_valid_rating(rating) - checks if a rating is between 0 and 10
is_valid_genre(genre) - checks if the genre is in the allowed genres list
